= Wave 1: Beyond the Horizon

== Your Story

*Commander [Name]*. That is what the dossier says now. Five years since the academy. Three sector assignments. One confirmed Ruin-class entity neutralized. Your service record is spotless, and Earth Command has noticed.

The new posting came encrypted — triple-sealed, Protectorate Priority Black. *Kappa Sector.* Fringe space. The kind of region where colony transponders go dark and patrol ships do not come back.

Your briefing was short: investigate anomalous readings near the Rim. Standard recon. But the coordinates match a set of ruins the Protectorate has been quietly tracking for decades — structures that predate every known civilization.

You have a new ship. A handpicked crew. A Matter Manipulator upgraded beyond academy specs. And a gnawing certainty that the Protectorate is not telling you everything.

Beyond the horizon, the real story begins.

== Setting the Tone

Wave 1 is about *mastery and mystery*. You know how to survive. Now you learn how to thrive — and you peel back the layers of a universe that is stranger and deeper than the academy ever taught.

Play with confidence. Push into dangerous territory. The mods in this wave add entire civilizations, new technology trees, and systems that make the galaxy feel alive in ways vanilla only hinted at.

#concept[
  *Roleplaying tip:* Keep your journal from Wave 0. Read back through it occasionally. The contrast between your cadet self and your commander self tells its own story. What would Cadet you think of the places Commander you now treads without hesitation?
]

== Wave 1 Mod Loadout

Nine categories of mods are active in this wave:

- *Graphics* — Enhanced visuals, parallax layers, planetary backgrounds, lighting
- *Races* — New playable species with custom ships, armor, and dialogue
- *Content* — Quests, planets, biomes, dungeons, and NPCs
- *Mechanics* — New techs, crafting chains, and survival systems
- *Ships* — Expanded ship building, custom SAIL interfaces, crew enhancements
- *Weapons and Armor* — New weapon types, armor sets, and procedural generation upgrades
- *Building* — Furniture packs, block sets, and colony expansions
- *Audio* — Music packs and ambient soundscapes
- *Adult* — Tasteful mature content that adds depth to the world

#warning[
  Start a *new save* for Wave 1. Do not load your Wave 0 character with Wave 1 mods. Content mods that add biomes, quests, or NPCs require a fresh universe to generate correctly.
]
